rectness\\n- Use the standard library only (no external dependencies unless absolutely necessary for Rust)\\n- The GitHub Actions workflow should be in `.github/workflows/` directory\\n- The workflow should have a meaningful name like `test-hello-world.yml`\\n\\n## Definition of Done\\n- [ ] Program file created with correct extension\\n- [ ] Code prints \\&quot;Hello, World!\\&quot; exactly\\n- [ ] Code is properly commented\\n- [ ] Code follows Rust conventions\\n- [ ] Instructions for running the program are included (if needed)\\n- [ ] GitHub Actions workflow created and passing\\n- [ ] CI badge showing build status (optional but recommended)&quot;,&quot;closed_by&quot;:null,&quot;reactions&quot;:{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://api.github.com/repos/konard/test-hello-world-019fb331-c107-78c7-8ff6-9f127a3c593c/issues/1/reactions&quot;,&quot;total_count&quot;:0,&quot;+1&quot;:0,&quot;-1&quot;:0,&quot;laugh&quot;:0,&quot;hooray&quot;:0,&quot;confused&quot;:0,&quot;heart&quot;:0,&quot;rocket&quot;:0,&quot;eyes&quot;:0},&quot;timeline_url&quot;:&quot;https://api.github.com/repos/konard/test-hello-world-019fb331-c107-78c7-8ff6-9f127a3c593c/issues/1/timeline&quot;,&quot;performed_via_github_app&quot;:null,&quot;state_reason&quot;:null,&quot;pinned_comment&quot;:null}[[]]{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://api.github.com/repos/konard/test-hello-world-019fb331-c107-78c7-8ff6-9f127a3c593c/pulls/2&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:4170235276,&quot;node_id&quot;:&quot;PR_kwDOToRS7c74kL2M&quot;,&quot;html_url&quot;:&quot;https://github.com/konard/test-hello-world-019fb331-c107-78c7-8ff6-9f127a3c593c/pull/2&quot;,&quot;diff_url&quot;:&quot;https://github.com/konard/test-hello-world-019fb331-c107-78c7-8ff6-9f127a3c593c/pull/2.diff&quot;,&quot;patch_url&quot;:&quot;https://github.com/konard/test-hello-world-019fb331-c107-78c7-8ff6-9f127a3c593c/pull/2.patch&quot;,&quot;issue_url&quot;:&quot;https://api.github.com/repos/konard/test-hello-world-019fb331-c107-78c7-8ff6-9f127a3c593c/issues/2&quot;,&quo