ample>\\n<example>\\nuser: What is the codebase structure?\\nassistant: [Uses the Task tool]\\n</example>\\n\\nIMPORTANT: Always use the TodoWrite tool to plan and track tasks throughout the conversation.\\n\\n# Code References\\n\\nWhen referencing specific functions or pieces of code include the pattern `file_path:line_number` to allow the user to easily navigate to the source code location.\\n\\n<example>\\nuser: Where are errors from the client handled?\\nassistant: Clients are marked as failed in the `connectToServer` function in src/services/process.ts:712.\\n</example>\\n\"},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":\"Here is some useful information about the environment you are running in:\\n<env>\\n  Working directory: /tmp/gh-issue-solver-1795390102259\\n  Is directory a git repo: yes\\n  Platform: linux\\n  Today's date: Sun Nov 22 2026\\n</env>\\n\\n<files>\\n  .cargo/\\n\\taudit.toml\\n.githooks/\\n\\tpre-commit\\n.github/\\n\\tactions/\\n\\t\\t[15 truncated]\\n\\tcodeql/\\n\\t\\t[1 truncated]\\n\\tworkflows/\\n\\t\\t[60 truncated]\\n\\tactionlint.yaml\\n\\tpull_request_template.md\\n\\trelease-advertisement.json\\n\\tzizmor.yml\\nanalysis/\\n\\tissue-488-todo.md\\nchangelog.d/\\n\\tREADME.md\\ncoverage/\\n\\tbaseline.json\\n\\tbrowser-unmeasured.txt\\ndata/\\n\\tagentic-coding/\\n\\t\\t[1 truncated]\\n\\tbenchmarks/\\n\\t\\t[52 truncated]\\n\\tcache/\\n\\t\\t[5 truncated]\\n\\tlanguage-additions/\\n\\t\\t[2 truncated]\\n\\tlexicon-import/\\n\\t\\t[1 truncated]\\n\\tmeta/\\n\\t\\t[198 truncated]\\n\\toverrides/\\n\\t\\t[3 truncated]\\n\\tparity/\\n\\t\\t[10 truncated]\\n\\tseed/\\n\\t\\t[257 truncated]\\n\\tsummarization/\\n\\t\\t[1 truncated]\\n\\ttraining/\\n\\t\\t[2 truncated]\\n\\tview/\\n\\t\\t[1 truncated]\\n\\tREADME.md\\n\\tsource-index.lino\\ndesktop/\\n\\tbuild/\\n\\t\\t[1 truncated]\\n\\tlib/\\n\\t\\t[17 truncated]\\n\\tscripts/\\n\\t\\t[30 truncated]\\n\\t.npmrc\\n\\tmain.cjs\\n\\tpackage-lock.json\\n\\tpackage.json\\n\\tpreload.cjs\\ndocker/\\n\\tco